if {StrangeTreeExamined} > 0:
	The bark hums, faintly, now that you're actually listening for it — the same low strain you feel behind your own eyes.
	Wait, what if I went *around* the tree!?
	[signal arg="ClearPath"]
else:
	It's too bad this tree is in the way...[pause=0.3] though something about standing this close to it makes the rattling in your chest go quiet, just for a moment.
	set {StrangeTreeExamined} = 1
[end_timeline]
